// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// NOTE: do NOT add GROUP/GRP_LOC region constraints for the DP logic on
// this device. Two attempts (with and without the CDC FIFO's BSRAMs in
// the group) sent the GW5AT placer into pathological legalization —
// 50 minutes and 9 HOURS of runtime respectively, both killed. clk_sym
// timing is instead closed in RTL (registered decision pipelining in
// video_stream_packer / sdp_engine, hdl/displayport).
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
